{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111137","id":2879588724,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rowl0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111137","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111137.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111137.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111137","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111137/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111137/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111137/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1da1ce0376c9148d52eb4ff15fbb22568fc96276","number":111137,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Speed up `Node::get_path_to` when inside tree","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR adds two additional codepaths to `Node::get_path_to` which use the cached depth information, if the node is in the tree. This allows to:\r\n- avoid using a HashSet for finding a common ancestor\r\n- know the size of the `Vector<StringName>` beforehand, which is used to resize the vector and prevent using `Vector::revert`\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Benchmarked using the following script</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\n\r\n# Called when the node enters the scene tree for the first time.\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tfor i in range(2, 19, 4):\r\n\t\tbenchmark_balanced(i)\r\n\t\tbenchmark_unbalanced(i)\r\n\r\nfunc benchmark_unbalanced(nodes: int):\r\n\tvar deep_node = self\r\n\tfor i in range(nodes - 1):\r\n\t\tvar new = Node.new()\r\n\t\tdeep_node.add_child(new)\r\n\t\tdeep_node = new\r\n\tvar shallow_node = Node.new()\r\n\tself.add_child(shallow_node)\r\n\t\r\n\tvar t1 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tshallow_node.get_path_to(deep_node)\r\n\tvar t2 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"Unbalanced n=\" + str(nodes))\r\n\tprint(\"\\tshallow->deep: \" + str(t2 - t1) + \" usec\")\r\n\t\r\n\tvar t3 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tdeep_node.get_path_to(shallow_node)\r\n\tvar t4 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"\\tdeep->shallow: \" + str(t4 - t3) + \" usec\")\r\n\r\nfunc benchmark_balanced(nodes: int):\r\n\tvar left = self\r\n\tvar right = self\r\n\tfor i in range(int(nodes / 2)):\r\n\t\tvar nl = Node.new()\r\n\t\tvar nr = Node.new()\r\n\t\tleft.add_child(nl)\r\n\t\tright.add_child(nr)\r\n\t\tleft = nl\r\n\t\tright = nr\r\n\tvar t1 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tleft.get_path_to(right)\r\n\tvar t2 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"Balanced n=\" + str(nodes) + \": \" + str(t2 - t1))\r\n\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nBenchmark (usec) 2 samples\r\n\r\n| n  |               | before    | optimize common ancestor | optimize push_back | both     |\r\n|----|---------------|-----------|----------------------|-------------|----------|\r\n| 2  | Balanced      | 1417      | 1291                 | 1431        | 959      |\r\n|    | shallow->deep | 1450      | 1235                 | 1260        | 1004     |\r\n|    | deep->shallow | 1460      | 1222                 | 1237        | 955      |\r\n| 18 | Balanced      | 4093      | 3419                 | 2508        | 1841     |\r\n|    | shallow->deep | 3832      | 3499                 | 2280        | 1870     |\r\n|    | deep->shallow | 4639      | 3531                 | 3104        | 1800     |\r\n\r\n<!--| 6  | Balanced      | 2087      | 1894                 | 1539        | 1192     |\r\n|    | shallow->deep | 2130      | 1927                 | 1506        | 1194     |\r\n|    | deep->shallow | 2150      | 1894                 | 1524        | 1206     |\r\n| 10 | Balanced      | 2937      | 2426                 | 1866        | 1419     |\r\n|    | shallow->deep | 2759      | 2740                 | 1765        | 1583     |\r\n|    | deep->shallow | 2969      | 2587                 | 1935        | 1398     |\r\n| 14 | Balanced      | 3440      | 2963                 | 2491        | 1638     |\r\n|    | shallow->deep | 3202      | 2886                 | 2072        | 1640     |\r\n|    | deep->shallow | 3774      | 3014                 | 2402        | 1588     |-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description"